{1 = 1-13}
9=1.	…… is destroyed. …… is destroyed. 
13=2.	It is destroyed. …… of @wDN{Nisaba} is destroyed. 
17=3.	The house of @wDN{Nisaba}, her of the tablets, is destroyed. 
21=4.	The house of …… is destroyed. 
25=5.	The house of @wDN{Nun-bar-še-gunu} is destroyed. ……, the @wTN{E-ḫamun} is destroyed. 
29=6.	The plants of lamentation have sprouted; 
33=7.	the @fsux{šumunda} grass has sprouted. 
37=8.	By the walls the long grass has sprouted. 
41=9.	Amongst them, 
45=10.	the willow trees are everywhere. 
49=11.	As for the word of @wDN{An} and the word of @wDN{Enlil}, 
53=12.	the angry heart of great @wDN{An} is everywhere, 
